-- Kuhn simplices through the face opposite the top vertex: lowering the base
-- at the last raised coordinate and shifting the permutation the other way
-- gives the second simplex through such a face
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
